{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alpine Skater</strong> takes mountain skating to the next level with tracks that span every kind of terrain the highlands can offer. From icy slopes and snow-dusted ridges to rugged rocky paths and many more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-12 Different challenges available in the game. Each mountain environment has its own physics, surface feel, and hazards, keeping the gameplay exciting and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Various different skaters available in the game and master unique tricks as you progress through diverse mountain regions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-With stunning scenery, dynamic challenges, and endless replayability, <i>Alpine Skater</i> is your ultimate ride across various different mountain tracks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cRide the Peaks, Master the Slopes.\u201d</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Beginner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3994690/daea392d3d79db3c9a80582bac5b5ae457317fef.jpg"},{"name":"Intermediate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3994690/2554e24ef86aa6083a0dd2b4867f0884969731bd.jpg"},{"name":"Expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3994690/0670468b2130f443e07c2f3b86011bef6656592f.jpg"},{"name":"Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3994690/32a9e6ba14814b91656c7a3497572d75a77339fa.jpg"},{"name":"Legend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3994690/df6349d54740291fab5bc4a5269bb3c6a028320e.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3994690?t=1760697053","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994690/a3a6cda90c5c18fd82fb75109a71e4d0896b46a8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760697053","capsule_